  "description": "Welcome to a world where your imagination comes first! Make up stories in the colourful locations, and customize your own buildings ΓÇô you can style your own outfits too!\n\nToca Boca World is all about open-ended play. There are no rules, just colorful ways to be creative. Build your world, and fill it with characters, pets, shops and all kinds of houses!\n\nAlmost everything inside Toca Boca World is customizable, or you can jump straight in and play! Try running a caf├⌐, become a hair stylist, camp in the forest or throw a rooftop party. ItΓÇÖs a safe universe where kids explore and discover at their own pace.\n\nBUILD YOUR OWN WORLD\n\nΓÇó Explore apartments, shops and hangouts in Bop City \nΓÇó Design your own characters with unique hair, faces, outfits and accessories \nΓÇó Decorate spaces with Home Designer. Change the walls, furniture and colors \nΓÇó Add pets, food, toys and silly items so each place feels like your own\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY\n\nΓÇó Create your own stories. Become a chef, spa owner, rockstar, or teacher \nΓÇó Mix and match locations to invent your own mini games and challenges \nΓÇó Move characters between homes, schools, shops and secret spots \nΓÇó Try roleplay like running a pet hospital, opening a fashion studio or hosting a sleepover\n\nEXPLORE, DISCOVER AND COLLECT\n\nΓÇó Find hidden gems, secret rooms and surprises in the locations\nΓÇó Visit the Post Office every Friday for free gifts including furniture, outfits, decorations and pets\nΓÇó Grow your world as new packs and locations are added to the in-app shop\n\nMADE FOR KIDS, EASY TO PLAY\n\nΓÇó Simple, touch-first controls make it usable for all reading abilities\nΓÇó No time limits or high scores. Just creative play\nΓÇó Open-ended design lets kids follow their own curiosity\n\nSAFE, SINGLE-PLAYER AND AD-FREE\n\nΓÇó Toca Boca World is a single-player kids' game, not chat and no strangers\nΓÇó COPPA compliant, and carefully designed as a safe space for kids\nΓÇó No third-party ads ever. Play is never interrupted by adverts or pop-ups\n\nAWARD-WINNING FUN FROM TOCA BOCA\n\nOur game has been recognized as App of the Year and an EditorΓÇÖs Choice for its playful design and dedication to kidsΓÇÖ safety. Our award-winning kids game can be downloaded on phones, tablets and computers, with optional in-app purchases for families who want to expand their world. We believe in the power of play. ThatΓÇÖs why Toca Boca World is built as a high-quality, ad-free game that lets children explore, create and imagine freely.\n\nSTAY CONNECTED\n\nDiscover new locations, events and collaborations by following Toca Boca World on social media and inside the in-app shop. ThereΓÇÖs always a new story waiting.",
